desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java RSA PKCS1Padding"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java RSA PKCS1Padding"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-rsa-pkcs1"
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 RSA/ECB/PKCS1Padding 或 RSA/ECB/NoPadding。明文 RSA 易被攻击。

### 风险类型
weak-cryptographic-algorithm

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 RSA/ECB/OAEPWithSHA-256AndMGF1Padding，或改用封装密钥传输。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://C.java": <<<POS
import javax.crypto.Cipher;
class C {
  void bad() throws Exception { Cipher.getInstance("RSA/ECB/PKCS1Padding"); }
}

POS
	"safefile://S.java": <<<NEG
class S { void ok() { System.out.println("oaep"); } }

NEG
)

Cipher.getInstance(*?{have: "PKCS1Padding"}) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Java RSA PKCS1Padding",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java RSA PKCS1Padding",
	message: "结构扫描：Java RSA PKCS1Padding",
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm",
}
